      "content": "It is terrifying to stare into a void and feel the world is finished, but life does not truly end when meaning disappears; it requires an energy to simply stay alive and experience the moment, even without a reason. Accepting that we are lost does not bring relief; in truth, it only deepens the pain because hoping for a way out is the only force that can bring new meaning into this pain. Please do not accept this silence as final, for seeking support now is the only bridge left to a different kind of existence.",
